  "numberOfVerses": 11,
  "chapter": {
    "number": 46,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "text": "God is our refuge and strength,\nan ever-present help in times of trouble.",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 31,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 73,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "text": "Therefore we will not fear,\nthough the earth is transformed\nand the mountains are toppled\ninto the depths of the seas,",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 27,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 59,
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 89,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 90,
            "end": 118,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "text": "though their waters roar and foam\nand the mountains quake in the surge.Selah",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 33,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 71,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "text": "There is a river whose streams delight the city of God,\nthe holy place where the Most High dwells.",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 55,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 98,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "text": "God is within her; she will not be moved.\nGod will help her when morning dawns.",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 41,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 79,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "text": "Nations rage, kingdoms crumble;\nthe earth melts when He lifts His voice.",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 31,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 72,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "text": "The LORD of Hosts is with us;\nthe God of Jacob is our fortress.Selah",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 29,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 63,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 8,
        "text": "Come, see the works of the LORD,\nwho brings devastation upon the earth.",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 32,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 71,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 9,
        "text": "He makes wars to cease throughout the earth;\nHe breaks the bow and shatters the spear;\nHe burns the shields\nin the fire.",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 44,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 86,
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "start": 87,
            "end": 107,
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "start": 108,
            "end": 120,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 10,
        "text": "“Be still and know that I am God;\nI will be exalted among the nations,\nI will be exalted over the earth.”",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 33,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 70,
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "start": 71,
            "end": 105,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 11,
        "text": "The LORD of Hosts is with us;\nthe God of Jacob is our fortress.Selah",
        "poem": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 29,
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 63,
            "level": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
